# Notifications (channel-agnostic)

- All outbound sends go through `NotificationChannel` in `lib/notifications/` — never call email/SMS/social providers from routes or components.
- Phase 1: **EmailChannel** only (real implementation).
- Phase 3+: **SocialMediaChannel** adapters (WhatsApp, SMS, etc.) — add implementations behind the same interface.
- Stubs must fail clearly (`NotImplementedError` / logged no-op) — no fake success.
- Cron routes (`/api/cron/*`) may call channels; UI and Server Actions call a shared service, not providers directly.
- Store channel type in DB as enum/string (`email`, `social_*`) — not vendor-specific table columns.
